parameters.help_en:
The access credential for the data source. Specify this parameter as needed for on-premises NAS data sources that use the SMB protocol, OSS protocol-compatible data sources, and S3 protocol-compatible data sources. Examples:
On-premises NAS data source (SMB protocol):
{
    "mountUsername": "\\*",
    "mountPassword": "\\*"
}
OSS protocol-compatible data source or S3 protocol-compatible data source:
{
    "accessKeyId": "\\*",
    "accessKeySecret": "\\*"
}

parameters.help_zh:
数据源访问凭证。对于SMB协议的本地NAS数据源、OSS协议兼容数据源和S3协议兼容数据源按需填写。示例：
本地NAS数据源（SMB协议）：
{
    "mountUsername": "\\*",
    "mountPassword": "\\*"
}
OSS协议兼容数据源/S3协议兼容数据源：
{
    "accessKeyId": "\\*",
    "accessKeySecret": "\\*"
}

parameters.help_en:
The connection information of the data source, which describes how to access the data source. Examples:
On-premises NAS data source:
{
    "dataServerAddresses": [
        {
            "host": "123.123.123.123",
            "port": "8080"
        }
    ],
    "sharePath": "/share",
    "mountOptions": "vers=3",
    "fileSystemType": "nfs"
}
CPFS for AI data source:
{"vpcMountTarget":"cpfs-010wn\\wy-vpc-ta\\8.cn-shanghai.cpfs.aliyuncs.com","sharePath":"/"}
Other large-scale file system data source:
{"path":"/mnt"}

parameters.help_zh:
